{%- comment -%}
  Filtros facetados — o MESMO markup na coleção e na busca (#141).

  Até a #141 este form morava dentro de `main-collection`, e a busca tinha só
  quatro abas que escondiam, em JS, o que já estava carregado na página atual.
  Copiar o form para a busca daria dois filtros que divergem com o tempo — o
  defeito que a regra `similarity` existe para impedir. Então ele saiu para cá,
  e as duas sections o renderizam.

  O `<form>` e o `<facet-filters>` que o envolvem ficam na SECTION: o form
  abraça também a barra de ferramentas e a grade, e o que vai nele (a busca
  precisa de `q` e `type`, a coleção não) é de cada página.

  Parâmetros:
  - part: o pedaço a renderizar (padrão: 'panel')
      'count'     devolve só o número de filtros ativos, para `capture`
      'relevant'  devolve 'true' se algum filtro descreve produto do resultado
      'trigger'   o botão que abre a gaveta no celular
      'panel'     o véu, a gaveta/sidebar com os filtros e o estilo dela
  - filters: `collection.filters` ou `search.filters` (count, relevant, panel)
  - active_filter_count: o que 'count' devolveu (trigger, panel)
  - sort_by: a ordenação atual, preservada ao aplicar filtro (panel)
  - clear_url: a página sem filtro nenhum, com a ordenação (panel)

  'count' e 'relevant' são decisão, e não usam nada da Shopify: são exercitados
  por `liquidjs` em `tests/facets.test.mjs` (ADR 0014).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case part -%}
  {%- when 'count' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Faixa de preço conta UMA vez, com mínimo, máximo ou os dois: para a
      cliente é um filtro só. Lista e booleano contam cada valor marcado.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign active_filter_count = 0
      for filter in filters
        if filter.type == 'price_range'
          if filter.min_value.value != blank or filter.max_value.value != blank
            assign active_filter_count = active_filter_count | plus: 1
          endif
        else
          assign active_filter_count = active_filter_count | plus: filter.active_values.size
        endif
      endfor
      echo active_filter_count
    -%}

  {%- when 'relevant' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A busca devolve artigo e página junto com produto, e filtro facetado só
      fala de produto. Uma busca que só achou artigo não pode mostrar um painel
      de "Disponibilidade (0)" com tudo desabilitado.

      Filtro marcado conta mesmo com zero resultado: é o estado em que a
      cliente mais precisa do painel, para desmarcar o que marcou.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign relevant = false
      for filter in filters
        if filter.type == 'price_range'
          if filter.range_max > 0 or filter.min_value.value != blank or filter.max_value.value != blank
            assign relevant = true
          endif
        else
          for value in filter.values
            if value.count > 0 or value.active
              assign relevant = true
            endif
          endfor
        endif
      endfor
      if relevant
        echo 'true'
      endif
    -%}

  {%- when 'trigger' -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      data-filters-open
      class="lg:hidden inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border rounded-theme px-4 py-2 text-sm text-foreground/80 hover:border-foreground/30 transition-colors"
    >
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 4h18M6 12h12M10 20h4" />
      </svg>
      {{ 'collection.filters.title' | t }}
      {%- if active_filter_count > 0 -%}
        <span class="color-badge inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-5 h-5 rounded-full text-xs px-1">{{ active_filter_count }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </button>

  {%- else -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Moeda com vírgula decimal (ex.: BRL, EUR): o param do Shopify espera
      ponto decimal e nenhum separador de milhar nos inputs de preço.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign comma_currencies = 'ANG,ARS,BRL,BYN,CLF,CLP,COP,CRC,CZK,DKK,EUR,HRK,HUF,IDR,ISK,MZN,NOK,PLN,RON,RUB,SEK,TRY,UYU,VND' | split: ','
      assign uses_comma_decimals = false
      if comma_currencies contains cart.currency.iso_code
        assign uses_comma_decimals = true
      endif
    -%}

    {%- comment -%} Sidebar inline no desktop, gaveta off-canvas no celular {%- endcomment -%}
    <div
      class="fixed inset-0 z-overlay bg-shadow/40 opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300 lg:hidden"
      data-filters-overlay
    ></div>
    <aside
      class="filters-panel fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-drawer w-5/6 max-w-xs -translate-x-full overflow-y-auto bg-background p-6 transition-transform duration-300 lg:static lg:z-auto lg:w-64 lg:max-w-none lg:translate-x-0 lg:overflow-visible lg:bg-transparent lg:p-0 lg:transition-none flex-shrink-0"
      data-filters-panel
      aria-label="{{ 'collection.filters.title' | t }}"
    >
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-20">
        {%- comment -%} Cabeçalho da gaveta (somente celular) {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6 lg:hidden">
          <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-label text-foreground/60">{{ 'collection.filters.title' | t }}</h2>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-filters-close
            aria-label="{{ 'collection.filters.close' | t }}"
            class="text-foreground/60 hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
          >
            {% render 'icon-close', size: 20 %}
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
          <h2 class="hidden lg:block text-xs uppercase tracking-label text-foreground/60">{{ 'collection.filters.title' | t }}</h2>
          {%- if active_filter_count > 0 -%}
            <a
              href="{{ clear_url }}"
              class="text-xs uppercase tracking-label text-foreground-muted hover:text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors"
            >
              {{ 'collection.filters.clear_all' | t }}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} Preserva a ordenação ao aplicar filtros {%- endcomment -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="sort_by" value="{{ sort_by }}">

        {%- for filter in filters -%}
          <details class="mb-4 border-b border-border pb-4" open>
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-medium flex justify-between items-center gap-2">
              <span>{{ filter.label | escape }}</span>
              <span class="filter-chevron shrink-0 transition-transform opacity-60">
                {% render 'icon-angle-down', size: 16 %}
              </span>
            </summary>

            {%- case filter.type -%}
              {%- when 'price_range' -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign min_input = ''
                  assign max_input = ''
                  if filter.min_value.value != blank
                    if uses_comma_decimals
                      assign min_input = filter.min_value.value | money_without_currency | replace: '.', '' | replace: ',', '.'
                    else
                      assign min_input = filter.min_value.value | money_without_currency | replace: ',', ''
                    endif
                  endif
                  if filter.max_value.value != blank
                    if uses_comma_decimals
                      assign max_input = filter.max_value.value | money_without_currency | replace: '.', '' | replace: ',', '.'
                    else
                      assign max_input = filter.max_value.value | money_without_currency | replace: ',', ''
                    endif
                  endif
                  if uses_comma_decimals
                    assign range_max = filter.range_max | money_without_currency | replace: '.', '' | replace: ',', '.'
                  else
                    assign range_max = filter.range_max | money_without_currency | replace: ',', ''
                  endif
                -%}
                <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-1">
                    <span class="text-xs text-foreground-muted">{{ cart.currency.symbol }}</span>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      inputmode="decimal"
                      name="{{ filter.min_value.param_name }}"
                      value="{{ min_input }}"
                      placeholder="0"
                      min="0"
                      max="{{ range_max }}"
                      aria-label="{{ 'collection.filters.from' | t }}"
                      class="w-full border border-border rounded-theme-sm px-2 py-1.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-foreground/40"
                    >
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-foreground-muted">—</span>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-1">
                    <span class="text-xs text-foreground-muted">{{ cart.currency.symbol }}</span>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      inputmode="decimal"
                      name="{{ filter.max_value.param_name }}"
                      value="{{ max_input }}"
                      placeholder="{{ range_max }}"
                      min="0"
                      max="{{ range_max }}"
                      aria-label="{{ 'collection.filters.to' | t }}"
                      class="w-full border border-border rounded-theme-sm px-2 py-1.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-foreground/40"
                    >
                  </div>
                </div>

              {%- else -%}
                {%- if filter.presentation == 'swatch' -%}
                  {%- comment -%} Filtro em swatch (cor/imagem via Search & Discovery) {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 max-h-64 overflow-y-auto">
                    {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign disabled = false
                        if value.count == 0 and value.active == false
                          assign disabled = true
                        endif
                      -%}
                      <label
                        class="filter-swatch relative block cursor-pointer {% if disabled %}opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed{% endif %}"
                        title="{{ value.label | escape }} ({{ value.count }})"
                      >
                        <input
                          type="checkbox"
                          class="filter-checkbox sr-only peer"
                          name="{{ value.param_name }}"
                          value="{{ value.value }}"
                          {% if value.active %}checked{% endif %}
                          {% if disabled %}disabled{% endif %}
                        >
                        <span
                          class="block w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-border bg-cover bg-center transition-shadow peer-checked:ring-2 peer-checked:ring-foreground peer-checked:ring-offset-2 peer-checked:ring-offset-background peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-foreground/40 peer-focus-visible:ring-offset-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-offset-background"
                          {% if value.swatch.image %}style="background-image:url({{ value.swatch.image | image_url: width: 48 }});"{% elsif value.swatch.color %}style="background-color:{{ value.swatch.color }};"{% endif %}
                        ></span>
                        <span class="sr-only">{{ value.label | escape }} ({{ value.count }})</span>
                      </label>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
                {%- else -%}
                  <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 max-h-64 overflow-y-auto">
                    {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign disabled = false
                        if value.count == 0 and value.active == false
                          assign disabled = true
                        endif
                      -%}
                      <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm cursor-pointer {% if disabled %}opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed{% endif %}">
                        <input
                          type="checkbox"
                          class="filter-checkbox rounded-theme-sm border-border text-foreground focus:ring-foreground/40"
                          name="{{ value.param_name }}"
                          value="{{ value.value }}"
                          {% if value.active %}checked{% endif %}
                          {% if disabled %}disabled{% endif %}
                        >
                        <span>{{ value.label | escape }}</span>
                        <span class="text-foreground-muted text-xs">({{ value.count }})</span>
                      </label>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
            {%- endcase -%}
          </details>
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- comment -%} Botão de aplicar (celular; e no desktop quando não há JS) {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="mt-6 lg:hidden" data-filters-apply>
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="w-full color-button text-xs uppercase tracking-label py-3 hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity rounded-theme"
          >
            {{ 'collection.filters.apply' | t }}
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <style>
      facet-filters .filters-panel.is-open { transform: translateX(0); }
      facet-filters [data-filters-overlay].is-open { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
      facet-filters details > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
      facet-filters details[open] .filter-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    </style>

    {%- comment -%}
      Sem JS: a gaveta não abre e o desktop não auto-envia. O form é GET, então
      basta mostrar os filtros no fluxo da página e o botão de aplicar em
      qualquer largura — e esconder o gatilho, que sem JS não faz nada.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <noscript>
      <style>
        @media (max-width: 1023.98px) {
          facet-filters .filters-panel { position: static; transform: none; width: auto; max-width: none; }
        }
        facet-filters [data-filters-open],
        facet-filters [data-filters-close] { display: none; }
        facet-filters [data-filters-apply] { display: block; }
      </style>
    </noscript>
{%- endcase -%}
